    "description": "<p><strong>Sigil</strong></p><h3>Seal</h3><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Very Close range. On a success, once per rest, they must mark <strong>1d4</strong> Stress. You clear a number of Stress equal to the number of Stress the target marked from this attack.</p><p><strong>Seal:</strong> After you successfully use this card, you can <strong>mark a Hit Point</strong> to flip it to its <strong>Release</strong> side.</p><h3>Release</h3><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Very Close range. On a success, once per rest, deal <strong>d12+4</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency. You clear a number of Hit Points equal to the number of Hit Points the target marked from this attack.</p><p><strong>Release:</strong> After you use this card, flip it back to its <strong>Seal</strong> side.</p>",
